Fetch models correctly for custom endpoints with provider: anthropic

loadConfigModels did not pass the endpoint's provider to fetchModels, so a
custom Anthropic-format endpoint got a Bearer header and `<baseURL>/models`.
Pass the provider; for anthropic use `<baseURL>/v1/models?limit=1000` with
x-api-key/anthropic-version headers. Validate the response shape and log
status/content-type instead of throwing a TypeError on non-JSON bodies.

